getColumnUniqueValues [SimTalk]
Returns an array with the values, which only are contained once in the specified column of the DataTable
designated by <Path>.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.getColumnUniqueValues(Column:any) → any[]
Parameter
The parameter Column of data type any designates the column.
The column has to be of data type String, Integer, Real, Time, Money, Length, Weight, Speed,
Acceleration, Date, or DateTime.
Return Value
The return value is an array of data type any.
Example
print MyDataTable.getColumnUniqueValues(1)
