insertColumn [SimTalk]
Adds an empty column to the left of the specified column into the DataTable designated by <Path>.
Remarks
Plant Simulation shifts all columns with an index equal to or greater than the parameter any one position
to the right.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.insertColumn(Column:any) → boolean
Parameter
The parameter Column of data type any designates the column number at which the empty column will be
inserted into the DataTable.
Return Value
The return value has the data type boolean.
Example
MyDataTable.insertColumn(8)
