deleteContents [SimTalk]
Deletes the contents of the DataTable designated by <Path>.
Remarks
The contents also includes the row index. If you also activated Settings > Column Index Belongs to
Contents in the format of the DataTable, the column index will be deleted as well.
Type
Method
Syntax
<Path>.deleteContents
Example
MyDataTable.deleteContents
See also
delete [SimTalk] - lists
deleteCellFormat [SimTalk]
Column Index Belongs to Contents
deleteContents [SimTalk]
