create [SimTalk] - DataTable
Creates a data structure without contents in the local variable designated by <var>.
Remarks
create only applies to a local variable of data type table.
Type
Method
Syntax
<var>.create
Example
var OrderList : table[string,real]
OrderList.create
OrderList[1,1] := "Cans"
OrderList[2,1] := 3000.0
See also
Data Types in Local Variables
